# sweep: --bare --seed-root apps/birds/fixtures/damaged
# A snapshot cut short says it could not be read and offers Refresh.
wait-for The latest birds could not be read
expect The file from your computer is damaged.
expect-missing JSON
expect Refresh
clean
shot birds-damaged
# A good push followed by Refresh brings the art back.
companion birds push scripts/fixtures/birds/older.json scripts/fixtures/birds/older.png --sim
tap Refresh
wait-idle
expect-missing The latest birds could not be read
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Shed Pi
